---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site.mjs';
---

<Base
  title="Contact"
  description="Report an error in a calculator, an outdated tax rule, or send a privacy request."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="page prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
      <h1>Get in touch</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        The most useful thing you can send is a rule we have wrong or out of date — with a link to the IRS source if you
        have one.
      </p>

      <h2>Email</h2>
      <p>
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>
      </p>

      <h2>Reporting a calculator problem</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Which page and which calculator mode you used.</li>
        <li>The inputs you entered and the result you expected.</li>
        <li>
          <strong>Please do not send your W-2, 1099 or tax return.</strong> Made-up numbers that reproduce the problem are
          all we need.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Privacy requests</h2>
      <p>
        The calculators run in your browser, so we generally hold no personal data about you. If you believe we do, email
        the address above and we will respond within 30 days. See the <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>What we cannot help with</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Personal tax advice or preparing your return — please use a tax professional.</li>
        <li>Your IRS account, refunds or notices — contact the IRS directly.</li>
        <li>Correcting your W-2 — only your employer can issue a Form W-2c.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
